flowchart LR
  RAW["Immutable raw survey snapshot"] --> CONTRACT["Approved estimand and survey design contract"]
  CONTRACT --> P["Python implementation maintained by primary team"]
  CONTRACT --> R["Separate R survey implementation maintained by independent team"]
  P --> PE["Primary point estimate and design SE"]
  R --> RE["Reference point estimate and design SE"]
  PE --> TEST["Registered tolerance reconciliation"]
  RE --> TEST
  TEST --> DEC{"Agreement and completeness?"}
  DEC -->|Yes| FACT["Versioned scientifically validated fact"]
  DEC -->|No| BLOCK["Statistical review and restricted draft"]
  TEST --> BENCH["Coverage and reproducibility benchmark log"]
